  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Journey to the Master\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Linnok_Courtyard.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Linnok Courtyard.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5a/Linnok_Courtyard.jpg/200px-Linnok_Courtyard.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"160\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5a/Linnok_Courtyard.jpg/300px-Linnok_Courtyard.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5a/Linnok_Courtyard.jpg/400px-Linnok_Courtyard.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Primary Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>\n<p>(<a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Canthan</a> only)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sister_Tai\" title=\"Sister Tai\">Sister Tai</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Panjiang_Peninsula\" title=\"Panjiang Peninsula\">Panjiang Peninsula</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Shing_Jea_Island\" title=\"Shing Jea Island\">Shing Jea Island</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Threat_Grows\" title=\"The Threat Grows\">The Threat Grows</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Road_Less_Traveled\" title=\"The Road Less Traveled\">The Road Less Traveled</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">Primary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Having warned the western part of Shing Jea Island about the threat the plague poses, hurry to Togo for further instructions on the east.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Canthan</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Character\" title=\"Character\">character</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Meet <a href=\"/wiki/Master_Togo\" title=\"Master Togo\">Master Togo</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Linnok_Courtyard\" title=\"Linnok Courtyard\">Linnok Courtyard</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>100 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Map travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Shing_Jea_Monastery\" title=\"Shing Jea Monastery\">Shing Jea Monastery</a> and go through the portal to Linnok Courtyard. Speak with Master Togo to collect your quest reward.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Sister Tai</dt></dl>\n<p><i><b>Master Togo</b> sent word that he wants to speak with you when you are finished here. He asked that you meet him back at the monastery in the <b>Linnok Courtyard</b>.</i>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"I will meet with Master Togo.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"I would rather stay here.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"Master Togo awaits you in the <b>Linnok Courtyard</b>.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Journey_to_the_Master&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Master Togo</dt></dl>\n<p><i>I am glad to hear you were able to warn the <a href=\"/wiki/Angchu\" title=\"Angchu\">Angchu</a> Tengu and help them drive off the plague creatures assaulting the village. I expected no less from you, &lt;Character name&gt;.</i>\n</p><p><i>Although I am loathe to place my students in the way of danger, I find that the current crisis leaves me little choice. I have sent <a href=\"/wiki/Yijo_Tahn\" title=\"Yijo Tahn\">Yijo Tahn</a> into the fray, and I hope that I can continue to count on you as well.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008161016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 372/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3560/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 911/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.218      1 -total\n 43.86%   11.061      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 43.10%   10.870      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n 12.88%    3.247      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n 12.07%    3.043      1 Template:Standard_prerequisites\n 10.77%    2.716      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n 10.36%    2.613      1 Template:Ask\n 10.26%    2.588      1 Template:Yes\n  9.96%    2.511      1 Template:No\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:24195-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008161016 and revision id 2627733.\n -->\n</div>"
